<title>USA: Atwood Oceanics Inc to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Atwood Oceanics Inc to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atwood Oceanics Inc said on Tuesday it will begin trading its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;ATW&quot; from August 6.</p>
<p>Atwood, a Houston-based international drilling contractor, currently trades under the symbol &quot;ATWD&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
